## CSS Colors

### Color Values

```css
.color-examples {
  /* Named colors */
  color: red;

  /* Hexadecimal */
  color: #ff0000;
  color: #f00; /* Shorthand */

  /* RGB */
  color: rgb(255, 0, 0);

  /* RGBA (with alpha/transparency) */
  color: rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.5);

  /* HSL (Hue, Saturation, Lightness) */
  color: hsl(0, 100%, 50%);

  /* HSLA */
  color: hsla(0, 100%, 50%, 0.5);

  /* Current color */
  color: currentColor;

  /* Transparent */
  color: transparent;
}
```

### Color Properties

```css
.color-properties {
  color: #333; /* Text color */
  background-color: #fff; /* Background color */
  border-color: #ccc; /* Border color */
  outline-color: #000; /* Outline color */
}
